, offers both meaningful rewards and a sense of purpose. Use the resources you\u2019ve earned through your efforts to shape your own growth and combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397040/extras/FATE_line.jpg?t=1751956360\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397040/extras/Destiny_01.gif?t=1751956360\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Kingdom\u2019s Fate Trembles at the Edge of the Wall</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The fall of the realm is no longer just an old tale. Each noble house now seeks the throne, driven by its own beliefs and ambitions. In this era of chaos, where loyalty and betrayal, war and unity intertwine, what will you choose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become the one who reshapes the fate of the kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["NYOU"],"genres":[{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397040/82799d310214bc9d512926b9c83b7837d173c2a2/header.jpg?t=1751956360","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257166354,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257166354/movie480.mp4?t=1751956359","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257166354/movie_max.mp4?t=1751956359"},"name":"CBT In-Game Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257166354/4166e581f0b09e66170cee13a10e53c9db54e468/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1751956359","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257166354/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1751956359","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257166354/movie_max_vp9.we